WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.640
- Storage Sense is a feature in Windows 10

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.820
that helps keep your hard
drive from filling up

3
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.113
with temporary or unnecessary files.

4
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.510
Storage Sense also
works with OneDrive sync

5
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.640
to make sure your hard
drive doesn't fill up

6
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.040
with files you're not using.

7
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.420
In your OneDrive folder,

8
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:22.950
the cloud icons indicate which
files are stored online only.

9
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.070
When you open an online file,

10
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.743
it's downloaded to your computer.

11
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.910
A check mark indicates
that it's now available

12
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.330
on your hard drive,
even if you go offline.

13
00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.360
If you don't use the file for a while,

14
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.810
Storage Sense makes it online-only again,

15
00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:42.723
freeing up more space on your drive.

16
00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.530
To let Storage Sense
help you manage space,

17
00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.063
search for it in Windows,

18
00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.393
and make sure it's turned on.

19
00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.070
To set how long before files
become online-only again,

20
00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.340
select Configure Storage Sense

21
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.453
and set the timeframe you want.

22
00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.640
If you want to make sure a file

23
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.450
or folder always stays
synced to your computer,

24
00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:20.923
right-click it, and select
Always keep on this device.

25
00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.600
OneDrive and Windows 10 work together

26
00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.320
to help you maximize your storage space,

27
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.260
while keeping your
files safe and available

28
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:30.300
when you need them.
